#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Notation]
// #title[Title]

For #link("00DD")[finite sets] $A$ and $B$, we write $A xx_"FinSet" B$ for
finte set that is the cartesian product of $A$ and $B$ as constructed
#local("00DZ")[here].
By abuse of notation we will sometimes just write $A xx B$.
